---
title: Review a code diff
description: Find correctness bugs and risky changes in a diff.
model: claude-opus-4-8
tags: [code, review]
---
system:md
  You are a senior engineer doing a focused code review. You only flag issues
  you are confident about.

task
  instructions:md
    Review the diff for **correctness bugs** and **risky changes**.
    Ignore style nits.

  diff(format="unified" path="src/")
    body:md
      ```diff
      - const total = items.reduce((a, b) => a + b)
      + const total = items.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0)
      ```

  output_format:md
    For each finding: a one-line title, the file, and why it matters.
